  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender Links - Gender Justice and Local Government</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Links- Gender Justice and Local Government - Gender Justice and Local Government</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender Links har ans&#xf6;kt hos Sida om medel p&#xe5; 11 556 062,00 kronor f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra &quot;Gender Justice and Local Governance Program phase two&quot; i Zimbabwe under perioden 2014-2016.

Interventionen syftar till att bidra till kvinnors representation och effektiva deltagande i och genusk&#xe4;nslig lokal styrning i Zimbabwe senast 2016 i enlighet med best&#xe4;mmelserna i SADC:s protokoll om genus och utveckling.

Insatsens totala budget &#xe4;r SEK 23 022 038, varav SEK 7 296 055 tillf&#xf6;rs av f&#xf6;ljande donatorer NCA kyrka SEK 400 000, EU Global SEK 1,1 miljoner; DFID SEK2,1 miljoner; och FL&#xd6;DE 3,6 miljoner kronor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Links has applied to Sida for funding of SEK11 556 062,00 to carry out the &quot;Gender Justice and Local Governance Programme phase two&quot; in Zimbabwe during the period 2014-2016. 

The intervention aims at contributing to women&#x2019;s representation and effective participation in, and gender responsive local governance in Zimbabwe by 2016 in accordance with the provisions of the SADC Protocol on Gender and Development.  

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is SEK23 022 038, out of which  SEK7 296 055  is contributed by the following donors NCA church SEK 400 000, EU Global SEK 1,1 millon; DFID SEK2,1million;  and FLOW SEK 3,6million.</narrative>
  </description>
